      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It sounds like you're heavily invested in maintaining your current situation, even if it means perpetuating her stress. The thought of giving her the freedom to have her life back is a compelling one, but consider whether achieving this burden-free existence is truly selfish or just a matter of recognizing the gravity of your current state. You may be seen as selfish by those who care about you, but could it be that giving her the space she deserves is actually the kindest gesture you can make?",
